  "2026-11-17T13:58:24.120Z",codex-sol,"Round AV verified results: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/ci-quick-contract.test.ts test/global-npm-guard.test.ts test/release-approval.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts PASS (263/263/0/0/0 tests/pass/fail/cancelled/skipped); npm run typecheck PASS; Initial workflow scan flagged three prose comments because a is now a valid family prefix. Reworded those comments without weakening comment scanning; expanded reference-based suite and every real workflow now pass.. Changelog regeneration/check follows these final tracker writes. Item remains in progress for orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-17T14:51:17.874Z",codex-sol,"Round AW: verifying four shared guard findings before edits: continuation forms must scan separately, link/ln can have implicit global effects, --g denotes global mode, and multiline npmrc writes must be checked against all run contents. Keep the line-based guard identical across all five packages, preserve existing fixtures, and run workflow/reference gates. No new tracker items or closures."
  "2026-11-17T14:57:40.181Z",codex-sol,"Round AW: reproduced all four findings against the unchanged guard, including the two-step npmrc workflow. Addresses PRRT_kwDOUMUq1864eCYU, PRRT_kwDOUMUq1864eYv2, PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc64esLn, PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc64esLy. The line-based guard now unions physical lines and three independent joins, applies the registry operand allowlist to implicit link/ln effects (including bare links), accepts one-letter global option prefixes, and checks npmrc writes against the whole run. Preserved every existing fixture; added accepted non-npm registry links and npmrc writes with no global/location mention. Guard MD5 02f427a1776c5b99d68b1c10b03a3939. Verified: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/global-npm-guard.test.ts test/release-approval.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts PASS (254/254/0/0/0 tests/pass/fail/cancelled/skipped); npm run typecheck PASS. All five PRs were open and mergeable; the pm-slack unresolved-thread read had no findings. Final changelog generation/check follows these tracker writes. Item remains in progress for orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-17T15:37:27.660Z",codex-sol,"Round AW late review PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64gC3N: reproduced empty findings for npm link --loglevel warn, npm ln --loglevel warn, and a command-looking option value before link. Option values must not masquerade as package operands for implicit links. Keep the scanner line-based: accept inline option values and known boolean global flags, but reject ambiguous unbound link options conservatively, including shell punctuation hidden in an option token. Existing accepted link -g some-tool remains accepted; added accepted inline-option registry links and rejected bare/options/punctuation regressions. Recheck the affected AN/reference suites and quality gates, then finalize tracker/changelog/source and regenerate the final self-host archive where required."
  "2026-11-17T15:45:47.912Z",codex-sol,"Round AW PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M64gC3N final refinement: read-only npm config queries confirmed that -g false and --g false consume a boolean option value. Empty inline values also fail closed. Verified: every existing fixture remains, new link-option and punctuation regressions reject, and known boolean global/inline-value registry links remain accepted. Full line-based guard MD5 0055f72ef4fb208809848324cb902d9a. Final affected gates: node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/global-npm-guard.test.ts test/release-workflow.test.ts test/release-approval.test.ts PASS (269/269/0/0/0 tests/pass/fail/cancelled/skipped); npm run typecheck PASS. Production package source and manifests did not change in this follow-up; prior expanded reference and real npm/Bun acceptance results remain applicable. Final tracker writes precede changelog regeneration/check. Leave this item in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-17T17:32:20.830Z",codex-sol,"Round BA: verified review gaps in workflow extraction, run-wide configuration and operand classification, or release-fixture generation order. Implement focused regression controls, retain existing fixture verdicts and run required package gates. No review-thread actions, merge or publication. Leave item open."
  "2026-11-17T17:52:35.221Z",codex-sol,"Round BA focused verification passed 291/291 across the required guard, release-workflow and release-approval files. The second-bootstrap-GITHUB_PATH-write mutation failed as required; duplicate approved writes also fail. The same slice in pm-ops already has the equivalent assertion and mutation controls; the other target release tests use caller contracts without this slice. Exact yaml 2.9.1 is now a direct devDependency, with only manifest/root-lock declarations changed. Typecheck passed. Additional package-reference acceptance is still running; one concurrent deadline-audit failure passed its isolated retry. No source change is needed for that replay. Final tracker release and changelog regeneration will follow the remaining results."
  "2026-11-17T18:20:59.212Z",codex-sol,"Full-depth package-reference validation continues after the required 291/291 review gates passed. All eight sync boundary matrices passed, and the 500-sequence seeded sync case has reached sequence 270 without a new reported failure. Packed npm/Bun acceptance passed across global, npx/bunx, local-bin and copied-extension shapes. Keep the full default sequence depth. Other review fixes are committed and verified; no pushes have occurred yet."
  "2026-11-17T18:38:12.063Z",codex-sol,"The full 500-sequence seeded sync reference case passed: 181 imports, 152 exports, 167 syncs, 500 exact replays and 50 older-revision replays. All eight edit/crash boundary matrices also passed. The separate 512-sequence interrupted-sync reference case is now running at full default depth. Required BA gates remain 291/291, with no additional reported failure beyond the concurrent deadline audit that passed separately."
  "2026-11-17T18:59:17.666Z",codex-sol,"Round BA final evidence: all supplied guard findings are fixed, including YAML 2.9.1 parsing and matrix.env metadata, complete env-key mentions, npmrc writers, separated option operands and forced-env exemption controls. PRRT_kwDOUMUq1864h4xj is covered by the restored single pinned bootstrap GITHUB_PATH write constraint and second-write/duplicate-write mutations. Required gate passed 291/291; typecheck, build and build:test passed. The complete process-fixture file passed 10/10 on isolated rerun; its initial concurrent EACCES came from traversing a preload-fixture symlink into an inaccessible temporary directory. The sync case directly referencing the package manifest passed 1/1. Packed npm/Bun acceptance, all eight edit/crash boundary matrices and all 500 seeded sequences passed. The broader soak was excessive for the test-only guard and dependency declaration; it was intentionally stopped during the separate 512-sequence case after reaching at least sequence 156. Its multi-file receipt is 617/619, including that interrupted file and the replayed EACCES; no full-sync pass is claimed. Guard md5 37eeb79e59b47af34f9466e1d264e893. This is the final tracker write sequence, followed by claim release, tag fetch and changelog regeneration/check before committing. Leave the item in progress; do not change protected timestamps. No PR merge, review-thread action, workflow dispatch or publication."
